<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$40.0 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$40.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian promissory note issuers came to the market for a total of A$40.0 million on Wednesday. All four issuers sold A$10 million of their paper each. All except Incitec Ltd sold their p-notes at about one basis point over the nearest bank bill rate.</p>
<p>Dealers said bank bill trading volumes were moderate.</p>
